<view class="page">
  <view class="row">
    <view>
      <view class="eyebrow">YOUR FRIDGE</view>
      <view class="title">食材，不浪费。</view>
    </view>
    <button class="mini" bindtap="photo">拍照 / 对话</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty">
    冰箱还没有记录。 添加一份食材，开始这一周。
  </view>
  <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card">
    <view class="row">
      <view class="grow">
        <view class="heading">{{item.food.name}}</view>
        <text class="muted">{{item.grams}} g · 到期 {{item.expires_on}}</text>
      </view>
      <text
        class="badge {{item.alert==='normal'?'':(item.alert==='near_expiry'?'warn':'error')}}"
      >
        {{item.alert==='normal'?'在库':(item.alert==='near_expiry'?'临期':(item.alert==='expired'?'已过期':'视觉不新鲜'))}}
      </text>
    </view>
    <text wx:if="{{item.estimated}}" class="badge warn">
      重量为估算，点击编辑可修正
    </text>
    <view class="row">
      <button class="mini secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit">
        编辑
      </button>
      <button class="mini secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="consume">
        记录消耗
      </button>
      <button class="mini danger" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="discard">
        丢弃
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="heading">{{editing?'修改食材':'手动入库'}}</view>
    <picker
      range="{{catalog}}"
      range-key="name"
      value="{{foodIndex}}"
      data-key="foodIndex"
      bindchange="field"
    >
      {{catalog[foodIndex].name || '选择食材'}} ▾
    </picker>
    <view class="label">可食用重量（克）</view>
    <input type="digit" data-key="grams" value="{{grams}}" bindinput="field" />
    <view class="label">确认食用期限（以包装 / 储存条件为准）</view>
    <picker
      mode="date"
      value="{{expires}}"
      data-key="expires"
      bindchange="field"
    >
      {{expires}}
    </picker>
    <view class="row label">
      <text>重量为估算</text>
      <switch checked="{{estimated}}" data-key="estimated" bindchange="field" />
    </view>
    <button loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="add">
      {{editing?'保存修改':'确认入库'}}
    </button>
    <button wx:if="{{editing}}" class="secondary" bindtap="cancel">
      取消编辑
    </button>
    <view class="divider" />
    <view class="heading">该食材的采购参考价</view>
    <input
      type="digit"
      data-key="price"
      value="{{price}}"
      bindinput="field"
      placeholder="元 / 千克"
    />
    <input
      data-key="source"
      value="{{source}}"
      bindinput="field"
      placeholder="城市 / 市场 / 报价来源"
    />
    <button class="secondary" bindtap="price">保存为估算参考价</button>
  </view>
  <view class="notice">
    历史精确实付价优先于参考价；未经确认的照片不会自动更改库存。只有管理员可录入、改价和编辑，成员可记录消耗。
  </view>
</view>
